{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>超強颱風薔琵迫近日本沖繩，逾200班航班取消，一萬八千多名旅客受影響。</p><p></p><p>受薔琵影響，沖繩石垣島周三風勢頗大。日本氣象廳錄得薔琵中心附近最大風速約每小時200公里，風力足以吹倒部分房屋。強風導致數以百計航班取消，連接沖繩本島和周邊離島的過百條渡輪航線亦停航。</p><p></p><p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Picture_J.JP.TYPHOON-1530_001.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/2026Sceu2tvBGL1792655033.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/>\n</p>\n</p><p></p><p>當局指，九州、日本西部等地區或會出現強降雨，影響預計持續到周末。氣象廳提醒周末計劃前往相關地區的民眾，留意暴雨、水浸和山泥傾瀉等風險。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T08:41:36.292515+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":196,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-22T07:11:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:55.485367+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T08:37:55.485367+00:00","content_hash":"dec5655ab3389b94d7e943da7b22592f5ac0b3fd0f5cf162a2f9b285e2ce0b65","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}